{"type":"standard","title":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Ohio","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Ohio</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q131985929","titles":{"canonical":"2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Ohio","normalized":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Ohio","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Ohio</span></span>"},"pageid":78902423,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Seal_of_Ohio_%28B%26W%29.svg/330px-Seal_of_Ohio_%28B%26W%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":330},"originalimage":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Seal_of_Ohio_%28B%26W%29.svg/960px-Seal_of_Ohio_%28B%26W%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":608,"height":608},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1383332660","tid":"f0d06231-d672-11f1-a4c2-28144a6c62f8","timestamp":"2026-11-02T04:07:38Z","description":"","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Ohio","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Ohio?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Ohio?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Ohio"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Ohio","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Ohio","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Ohio?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Ohio"}},"extract":"The 2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Ohio will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the fifteen U.S. representatives from the state of Ohio, one from each of the state's congressional districts. The elections coincide with other elections to the House of Representatives, a special election to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections. The primary elections took place on May 5, 2026.","extract_html":"<p>The <b>2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Ohio</b> will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the fifteen U.S. representatives from the state of Ohio, one from each of the state's congressional districts. The elections coincide with other elections to the House of Representatives, a special election to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections. The primary elections took place on May 5, 2026.</p>"}